      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you aren't a doctor, but you have so much info so i figured i'd ask. it's not really \"severe\" yet, it's just a constant nagging ache on that right side. it's not like i'm doubled over or anything, i can still walk around fine. i just really hate hospitals. do you think it's actually worth going to the ER for something that feels like it's just digestive issues? like, could it just be something i ate?",
